@startuml
[*] --> SearchQueryReceived

SearchQueryReceived --> ProcessingSearch : Process query
ProcessingSearch --> SentimentAnalysis : Analyze sentiment
SentimentAnalysis --> GeneratingSummary : Generate summary
GeneratingSummary --> FilteringResults : Apply filters
FilteringResults --> DisplayingResults : Display results
DisplayingResults --> [*] : Return to initial state

ProcessingSearch --> [*] : Error or cancel
SentimentAnalysis --> [*] : Error or cancel
GeneratingSummary --> [*] : Error or cancel
FilteringResults --> [*] : Error or cancel
DisplayingResults --> [*] : Error or cancel
@enduml
